#only("1")[
#voiceover("Let's review with an example. We'll solve the equation x squared minus 5x plus 6 equals 0.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("First, we note that our equation is already in standard form, with all terms on the left side and zero on the right.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Next, we factor the left side. We get x minus 2 times x minus 3 equals 0.")
]
#only("4")[
#voiceover("Now, we set each factor to zero: x minus 2 equals 0, or x minus 3 equals 0.")
